  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\nLogic: The operation “@” is defined as **a @ b = (a + b)²**\n\n2 @ 3 = (2 + 3)² = 5² = 25 \n\n3 @ 4 = (3 + 4)² = 7² = 49 \n\nSimilarly, 4 @ 5 = (4 + 5)² = 9² = 81 \n\nHence, the correct answer is **Option 1**.",
